[PrintTextModified Text:又过了几天。<br>艾玛等人的越狱计划正在顺利推进。|#0102Adv07_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（接下来，只要能说服亚里沙……）|#0102Adv07_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_1 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛起床后，<br>决定今天继续寻找亚里沙。|#0102Adv07_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我已经连续劝说她好几天了……<br>　可是怎么都说不动）|#0102Adv07_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙对越狱的态度并不消极，<br>而且看上去也不是特别抵触去帮我们。|#0102Adv07_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（难道说——<br>　她是害怕被委以重任……？）|#0102Adv07_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不过，我今天一定要说服亚里沙！<br>　有可能的话，我还想找到奈叶香！）|#0102Adv07_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在有限的放风时间里，<br>艾玛四处奔走。|#0102Adv07_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

